erous to other, and it plays into the shared power pool trope if some smart Elans want to work together and buff the others.<br /> <br /> Oh, that makes sense.<br /> <br /> Yes. Though I think it might be worthwhile to limit to things that can use or transmute mana. So my justification for it is that Mage\u2019s have the plenty potential to be Elans, but they just aren\u2019t using it right. Non-Mages aren\u2019t using that mental energy, so the Elan can barrow their power without issue. I\u2019d only exclude sleepers from the list. Hopefully that makes sense.<br /> <br /> Edit: wording</div> </div> </div> </div>Aaaand updated. Of note - I specified that the gemstone and Mana Battery Yantras can stack into a single Yantra, for a maximum of +3 when using a Perfected jewel Mana Battery. Similarly, an targeting an Elan you've networked to and drawn Mana from gets a whopping +4 Yantra","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-07T20:47:28-07:00","id":1543316,"title":"","content":"So super late to an old post. My apologies but it almost sounds like an Astral attuned Legacy along the lines of the Scions of God. It makes me think of the 1e spell Twilight Temple. Like the Masters o